          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>An easy way to trick others is to throw your voice into a nearby forest or thicket to make strange noises. You can cast 2nd-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ventriloquism] as an innate primal spell once per day. You can also cast the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Figment] cantrip as a primal innate spell at will, heightened to a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up.</p>"
