          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You Drop Prone or otherwise become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p><hr /><p>As you fall to the ground, you transform into a white bottle, gourd, or sake jar, then roll away before anyone can pick you up. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Crawl] up to two times, and your movement doesn't provoke reactions—you somehow always roll just out of reach. When you come to a stop, you return to your tanuki form, face down on the ground.</p>"
